# music-player-hq library roots. One "root=<abs path>" per line;
# recursive .mp3 scan, AppleDouble ._* skipped, missing dirs ignored.
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored. File Explorer
# "ADD to library" (v2) will append here; for now edit by hand.
#
# Keep roots LOCAL and reasonably sized - the scan is a blocking nftw()
# at startup (capped at 300 tracks). A slow network/USB mount here will
# stall the first render.
root=/home/no/Downloads
# root=/media/no/b7ced73c-5231-4462-b98d-64e38fe2df9e/home/jbez/Music
